---
---
<section id="agents" class="agents bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">For agents</p>
    <h2>Point your agents at it.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Read-only static feeds, designed so tooling — not just humans — can read what is already validated. Spec preview below; not deployed.
    </p>

    <div class="agents-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>What an agent gets</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Validated entries with confirmed summaries.</li>
          <li>Tags indexed for fast filtering.</li>
          <li>Confidence scores you can request or ignore.</li>
          <li>No auth flow. Cached. Plain JSON.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="code-block">
        <p class="code-label">GET /tags.json</p>
<pre><code>{`{
  "agents": 12,
  "evals": 9,
  "rag": 7,
  "alignment": 4,
  "tools": 11
}`}</code></pre>
        <p class="code-label">GET /feed.json?tag=evals</p>
<pre><code>{`[
  {
    "title": "...",
    "url": "...",
    "tags": ["evals", "agents"],
    "rank": 0.94,
    "confirmed_by": 3
  }
]`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small">Spec preview — endpoints not deployed in this build.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .agents {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .agents .lede { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .agents-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .agents-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .agents-grid ul {
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
  }
  .agents-grid li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .code-block {
    background: var(--frame);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .code-label {
    color: var(--magenta);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .code-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .code-block pre {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .small { font-size: 0.78rem; font-family: var(--mono); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
